<apex:page showHeader="false" standardStylesheets="false" 
   controller="SaveToPDF" renderAs="{! renderAs }">
   <apex:form rendered="{! renderAs != 'PDF' }" style="text-align: right; margin: 10px;">
      <div>
         <apex:commandLink action="{! print }" value="Save to PDF"/>
      </div>
      <hr/>
   </apex:form>
   <h1>PDF Fonts Test Page</h1>
   <p>This text, which has no styles applied, is styled in the default font for the 
      Visualforce PDF rendering engine.
   </p>
   <p>The fonts available when rendering a page as a PDF are as follows. The first 
      listed <code>font-family</code> value for each typeface is the recommended choice.
   </p>
   <table border="1" cellpadding="6">
      <tr>
         <th>Font Name</th>
         <th>Style <code>font-family</code> Value to Use (Synonyms)</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
         <td><span style="font-family: Arial Unicode MS; font-size: 14pt; ">Arial 
            Unicode MS</span>
         </td>
         <td>
            <ul>
               <li><span style="font-family: Arial Unicode MS; font-size: 14pt;">Arial Unicode MS - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Arial Unicode MS; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Arial Unicode MS - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Arial Unicode MS; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Arial Unicode MS - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</b></span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Arial Unicode MS; font-size: 14pt;"><strong>Arial Unicode MS - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</strong></span></li>
            </ul>
         </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
         <td><span style="font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14pt;">Helvetica - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></td>
         <td>
            <ul>
               <li><span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;">sans-serif - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: SansSerif; font-size: 14pt;">SansSerif - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Dialog; font-size: 14pt;">Dialog - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
            </ul>
         </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
         <td><span style="font-family: Times; font-size: 14pt;">Times - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></td>
         <td>
            <ul>
               <li><span style="font-family: serif; font-size: 14pt;">serif - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Times; font-size: 14pt;">Times - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
            </ul>
         </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
         <td><span style="font-family: Courier; font-size: 14pt;">Courier - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></td>
         <td>
            <ul>
               <li><span style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 14pt;">monospace - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Courier; font-size: 14pt;">Courier - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: Monospaced; font-size: 14pt;">Monospaced - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
               <li><span style="font-family: DialogInput; font-size: 14pt;">DialogInput - 株式会社昭和  東京営業所</span></li>
            </ul>
         </td>
      </tr>
   </table>
   <p><strong>Notes:</strong>
   <ul>
      <li>These rules apply to server-side PDF rendering. You might see different results 
         when viewing this page in a web browser.
      </li>
      <li>Text styled with any value besides those listed above receives the default font 
         style, Times. This means that, ironically, while Helvetica's synonyms render as 
         Helvetica, using "Helvetica" for the font-family style renders as Times. 
         We recommend using "sans-serif".
      </li>
      <li>Arial Unicode MS is the only multibyte font available, providing support for the 
         extended character sets of languages that don't use the Latin character set.
      </li>
   </ul>
   </p>
</apex:page>